Task 3: Tune Database Configuration
Step 1: Check Current Configuration
-- View current settings
SHOW shared_buffers;
SHOW work_mem;
SHOW maintenance_work_mem;
SHOW effective_cache_size;
Step 2: Calculate Optimal Settings
For a system with 4GB RAM, use these guidelines:

shared_buffers: 25% of RAM = 1GB
effective_cache_size: 50-75% of RAM = 2-3GB
work_mem: 25MB - 50MB per connection
maintenance_work_mem: 256MB - 1GB
